ut. But should I include technical skills or focus more on soft skills? I’ll have to think through what would be most helpful in a general context. I’ll get to work on this now!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I can use these skills when relevant:\n\n- healthcheck — security/hardening checks for OpenClaw machines\n- skill-creator — create, improve, audit, or clean up skills\n- weather — current weather and forecast\n- dumb-calculator — simple random addition generator\n- kidney-cancer-detection — analyze kidney medical images for possible cancer signal\n- nephrology-klm — kidney/nephrology specialist knowledge support\n- patient-klm — read/update patient knowledge-base records\n- pipeline-execution — run the fixed kidney ML prototype pipeline on an image\n- pipeline-generator — generate an ML pipeline prototype from a prompt\n- user-medical-data-update — store and summarize structured user medical data over time\n\nAnd beyond skills, I can also help with general medical reasoning, red-flag screening, symptom interpretation, reminders, web lookup, and workspace/file tasks. What do you want to use one for?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0828df2910ebc5230169b7eeafa5b48191b80a07a26946268a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":338,"output":210,"cacheRead":9088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9636,"cost":{"input":0.000845,"output":0.00315,"cacheRead":0.0022719999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006267}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773661867965}}
