ields:\n- `node_category`\n- `node_sub_category`\n- `node_name`\n- `node_label`\n- `node_description`\n- `endpoints`\n- `allowed_node_types`\n- `style`\n- `data`\n- `children`\n- `tracking`\n- `node_name_dict`\n- `executed`\n- `node_id`\n- `prototype_id`\n\n### `...children[0].data.general_parameters`\n- `age`\n- `localization`\n- `dx_type`\n- `sex`\n- `input_df`\n- `secret_key`\n- `text_column_name`\n- `model_path`\n- `storage_ref`\n- `computing_machines`\n\n#### `...computing_machines[]`\n- `machine_id`\n- `machine_name`\n\n### `...children[0].data.specific_parameters`\n- `language`\n- `model_type`\n- `entity_types`\n\n### `...children[0].tracking`\n- `run_id`\n- `start`\n- `experiment_name`\n- `workflow_name`\n- `workflow_type`\n- `workflow_id`\n- `workflow_run_id`\n- `tags`\n- `parameters`\n- `metrics`\n- `artifacts`\n\n#### `...children[0].tracking.tags`\n- `additionalProp1`\n- `additionalProp2`\n- `additionalProp3`\n\n#### `...children[0].tracking.parameters`\n- `Inference time`\n- `classes`\n- `confidence`\n\n#### `...children[0].tracking.artifacts`\n- `input_file`\n- `output_file`\n- `input_dataframe`\n- `model_file`\n\n## Nested child: Image Analyzer\nPath:\n`response.workflows[0].branches[0].nodes[0].children[0].children[0]`\n\nFields:\n- `node_category`\n- `node_sub_category`\n- `node_name`\n- `node_label`\n- `node_description`\n- `endpoints`\n- `allowed_node_types`\n- `style`\n- `data`\n- `children`\n- `tracking`\n- `node_name_dict`\n- `executed`\n- `node_id`\n- `prototype_id`\n\n### `...children[0].children[0].data.general_parameters`\n- `input_df`\n- `secret_key`\n- `text_column_name`\n- `model_path`\n- `storage_ref`\n- `computing_machines`\n\n### `...children[0].children[0].data.specific_parameters`\n- `language`\n- `model_type`\n- `entity_types`\n\n### `...children[0].children[0].tracking`\n- `run_id`\n- `start`\n- `experiment_name`\n- `workflow_name`\n- `workflow_type`\n- `workflow_id`\n- `workflow_run_id`\n- `tags`\n- `parameters`\n- `metrics`\n- `