{"type":"message","id":"ad7b7adf","parentId":"660fc579","timestamp":"2026-03-16T12:09:45.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Done — the kidney ML pipeline ran successfully on this image.\n\n### Main result\n- **Kidney cancer class:** kidney_tumor\n- **Confidence:** 0.9999781847000122\n- **Image Analyzer prediction:** kidney_tumor\n\n### CAM findings\n- **CAM coverage:** 0.012755102040816327\n- **CAM center ratio:** 0.8249999997937499\n- **CAM left-right asymmetry:** 0.099999999975\n- **CAM top-bottom asymmetry:** 0.99999999975\n- **CAM explanation:** the model focused on a localized central region in the renal parenchyma with asymmetric spatial distribution, which in this pipeline was interpreted as consistent with a tumor-type signal\n\n### Run details\n- **Upload path:** `upload/2026-03-16_12.09.13_2d4sAjaieji6aqJHWzlq/file_0---33404996-0f8a-42d2-ab81-d68addcff5e5.jpg`\n- **Analyzer output image:** `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b7ce309fc31ca2c4714132/be7ab3be-c8c5-4c16-8bae-355534ce68df.jpg`\n- **Pipeline status:** success (`HTTP 200`)\n\nImportant caution: this is still a prototype model output, not a diagnosis. If you want, I can next format future runs in exactly this same layout automatically, or compare all three runs side by side.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0828df2910ebc5230169b7f302293481918dd3c531e73454c4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9298,"output":368,"cacheRead":53248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62914,"cost":{"input":0.023245000000000002,"output":0.00552,"cacheRead":0.013312,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.042077}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773662973128}}
